+**Book**: The act of recording a new Visit against a Pet. Relationships: Booking a Visit creates exactly one Visit; a Visit once recorded is a booked visit. Avoid: Schedule, Create (in prose). *Added 2026-10-24 to reconcile the PRD's long-standing "book" wording with the Visit entry; not part of the derived survey.*
+
+**Correction**: A change to the recorded details of an existing Owner, Pet, or Visit that keeps it the same record. Relationships: A Correction changes exactly one existing record and adds none; for a Visit it covers the date and description. Avoid: Amendment, Update (in prose). *Added 2026-10-24 from the owner's intake wording ("never corrected", "correcting its date and description"); not part of the derived survey.*
 
